a&_nc_ohc=rf8KE3qHEHkQ7kNvwHkHJZO&_nc_oc=AdrKmqO9-5IWdsH46d-5oqBjjepMxCjVhT8S5VOGcuF5tIHE6fn1cM1Uv0KP1Cycrck&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR23bhaYmBdylqGaukSc82He4r0XH4s3Rp5MR7j_k4jaQ&oe=6B09C7B9"}, {"file_name": "VideoWall_1.18.1.png", "id": "961945845417678", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974845_961945852084344_6533138472087779742_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DT98T-f8Su4Q7kNvwGHOlcd&_nc_oc=AdrbzjQ2H_fA-jClRzWIcLKm33eyMoSBpwx-DBIBbeMhbEoLN9SEherdvEZlnyAy7u0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSutF78x5kx7ULXvLA_EHr3uorx24IO3qCM7iKyLNV_Dw&oe=6B09A165"}, {"file_name": "stepseq2_1.22.2.png", "id": "250093507859189", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982503_250093511192522_4388969349790307505_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3TtG4EVH174Q7kNvwEkI29f&_nc_oc=Adq2oxNg4aE0sVrG_-95N4GaoUc_oFZO98rKy3m8f8P2XZKCrd_3IiyfYweCFab-BYI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQScUDsSilCgwM9d4UiRlumdLbfZFWJnRXf2WYBa89Wq3w&oe=6B09CD08"}, {"file_name": "Session_1.23.1.png", "id": "795767698985101", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001732_795767702318434_262560137887527662_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7YHgc_mGW3QQ7kNvwHQ-wkE&_nc_oc=AdrbkqlCLX9_JTe49gOlrgqs81R6uA8wpCcncZMzRHNKMNNMmoodwaltN5LlxHohAaE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTFebAyj07wIE579iFWTI1ajpmHoh4r3WEAwQ0azEJcEg&oe=6B09AB3A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "tranzfirstframe.png", "id": "381471740929152", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39036702_381471744262485_3617820370637424030_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GMVE57k8b7oQ7kNvwHIStih&_nc_oc=AdooZGHSJ5swuaFqqejgfsbcPMYOTqEZQVVG8pfZUkDQmWh-QOZVzuHI3ljUApeeys4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQLC984GHxwy8soxpQ0y8LDxINxkQHwGjL8AkdllBrejA&oe=6B09C64E"}, "display_name": "Tranzient", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Make beats in VR - This is not a rhythm game!\n\nImmerse yourself in live looping and music production in VR.\n\n- Full support for hand tracking and mixed reality/passthrough \n- Synced looping with content library, auto time-stretched and pitch-shifted to fit the song.\n- Record vocals including mo-cap and replay of your avatar.\n- Use your custom Ready Player Me avatar.\n- Set of drum kits/one-shots.\n- Use Decks to create a seamless mix.\n- Full set of audio FX applied per clip or per scene (reverbs, chorus etc). \n- Loop record automation of audio FX parameters and synth parameters.\n- Assignable 3D control of FX and synth parameters.\n- Loop videos synced to the beat.\n- Step sequencer - trigger any item in the world and loop record instruments/drumkits. Edit steps, swing quantize.\n- Built in Analog Synth sim and Wavetable synth with >250 Sounds\n- Spatial Mixing - create a binaural mix based on clip positions.\n- In game camera and screen/mirror.\n\n\nIn the full version you get:\n- Built in 1.5 Gb library of loops and sounds\n- Use any number of synths (up to what the system can handle)\n- Use your own video and loops/samples\n- Export mixes of your performance\n- Lots more built in videos, VFX, Avatars and worlds.", "short_description": "The full version of Tranzient!\n\nMake beats in VR. Full live looping music production and sequencing environment in VR including visuals. \n\nThis is not a rhythm game.\n\nWho made the beats? You did!\n\nIn the full version you get:\n- Built in 1.5 Gb library of loops and sounds\n- Use any number of synths (up to what the system can handle)\n- Use your own video and loops/samples\n- Export mixes of your performance\n- Lots more built in videos, VFX, Avatars and worlds."}]}, "developer_name": null, "dev